# Netlify and Cloudflare Pages read this file; other hosts ignore it.
#
# The event database sends no CORS headers, so a browser can't read it from
# this app's origin. Forwarding a same-origin path to it is what lets the room
# dialog re-check that its events haven't moved since the schedule was
# imported. Without this the app still works — the check just reports that it
# couldn't reach the source. See src/hooks/useLocationCheck.ts.
/eventdb/*  https://gencon.eventdb.us/:splat  200
